{"author_date": "2026-07-05T15:01:17Z", "author_login": "tapios", "commit_date": "2026-07-08T05:11:41Z", "committer_login": "tapios", "message": "LookupBundle: typed lookup container + on-disk cache (W3 + W6)\n\n- `lookup_tables` now returns a typed, documented `LookupBundle` instead of the\n  nested `(; lookups, lu_kwargs)` NamedTuple \u2014 the last \"stringly typed\"\n  surface flagged by the audits. Stable fields for the gas/cloud/aerosol\n  tables (each `nothing` when absent), the gas/aerosol name\u2192index maps, and\n  the band/gas counts; `Adapt`-able for device transfer. Consumers drop one\n  nesting level (`bundle.lookup_lw`, `bundle.nbnd_lw`), and the wrong-mode\n  getter guards dispatch on `isnothing(field)` instead of `hasproperty`. The\n  duplicated gray `lookup_tables` method in the NCDatasets extension is gone\n  (the gray method lives in src and needs no NetCDF).\n\n- New `save_lookup_tables(path, bundle)` / `load_lookup_tables(path,\n  grid_params)`: cache the bundle on disk with Julia's Serialization stdlib\n  (host-side copies; re-adapted to the device on load). Once a cache exists,\n  the spectral methods run without NCDatasets \u2014 the standalone/classroom\n  workflow the api.jl FUTURE-IMPROVEMENT note asked for. Documented as a\n  same-Julia-version cache, not an interchange format; the NetCDF artifacts\n  remain the source of truth. Round-trip covered by\n  test/lookup_serialization.jl (structure, index maps, table payloads, gray\n  all-nothing bundles).\n\nFull test suite passes, including the type-stability/zero-allocation contracts\n(LookupBundle is a concrete solver type parameter, as the NamedTuple was).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>", "sha": "0fef4295677d6702e18d6c7e7b8623e48eed06c0"}
{"author_date": "2026-07-11T22:37:10Z", "author_login": "tapios", "commit_date": "2026-07-11T22:37:10Z", "committer_login": "tapios", "message": "Docs: Add comprehensive docstrings, how-to guides, tutorials, and performance comparisons", "sha": "7c099d001d8fe488ba36e605307bf3f37ca86bdd"}
